<title>USA: Nitches sets special dividend.</title>
<headline>Nitches sets special dividend.</headline>
<dateline>SAN DIEGO 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nitches Inc said Tuesday its board of directors has approved a special dividend of $1.00 per share to be paid to holders of record as of September 13 on September 30.</p>
<p>Shares of Nitches were up 1/4 at 8 in midday trading on Nasdaq.</p>
